Package: mhcp
Title: Multiplicative Half-Cauchy Processes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
      given = "Siddhesh",
      family = "Kulkarni",
      email = "siddhesh.s.kulkarni@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Description: Tools for simulation, probability calibration, and
    threshold-based effective-dimension summaries for the
    multiplicative half-Cauchy process. The package implements
    log-scale simulation, characteristic-function inversion,
    quantile-based prior calibration, multiplicative excursion
    probabilities, and related utilities.
